  "summary": "在按单空格分隔的文本中，每当连续单词 first、second 出现，收集紧随其后的第三个单词。",
  "insight": "分词后扫描三元窗口，前两项匹配时加入第三项即可。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "匹配区分大小写",
    "相邻匹配可重叠",
    "末尾只有两个词时没有第三词可收集"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "three-word-window-scan",
      "title": "三词窗口扫描",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "逐个检查相邻三词的前两项。",
      "steps": [
        "words=text.split 空格",
        "i 从零到 words.length-3",
        "若 words[i]==first 且 words[i+1]==second，加入 words[i+2]；返回字符串数组"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(text length)",
        "space": "O(text length)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/three-word-window-scan/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/three-word-window-scan/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/three-word-window-scan/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
